{"text": "What if you had one day in Delhi, and you had to spend as much money as humanly possible? 7 AM. You're hungry. So you buy every plate of chole bhature in Chandni Chowk. 9 AM. Traffic is bad. So you buy every auto rickshaw in Delhi... and paint them gold. 11 AM. The Metro is crowded. So you buy the whole Metro. Now it only stops at your house. 1 PM. Lunch. A swimming pool full of butter chicken. [laughs] And you jump in. 4 PM. Karol Bagh. You walk out wearing 80 kilos of gold. You can't move. 7 PM. You throw a baraat. For no reason. Ten thousand dhol players. Fireworks. 10 PM. The air is bad. So you buy a fan as tall as Qutub Minar. All of Delhi can breathe. Midnight. Total spent: 5 lakh crore rupees. Your bank calls. So you buy the bank. [excited] But the best deal of the day? Draw any sketch, and Vi3W turns it into a 3D model in 30 seconds.", "spoken": "What if you had one day in Delhi, and you had to spend as much money as humanly possible? 7 AM. You're hungry. So you buy every plate of chole bhature in Chandni Chowk. 9 AM. Traffic is bad. So you buy every auto rickshaw in Delhi... and paint them gold. 11 AM. The Metro is crowded. So you buy the whole Metro. Now it only stops at your house. 1 PM. Lunch. A swimming pool full of butter chicken. [laughs] And you jump in. 4 PM. Karol Bagh. You walk out wearing 80 kilos of gold. You can't move. 7 PM. You throw a baraat. For no reason. Ten thousand dhol players. Fireworks. 10 PM. The air is bad. So you buy a fan as tall as Qutub Minar. All of Delhi can breathe. Midnight. Total spent: 5 lakh crore rupees. Your bank calls. So you buy the bank. [excited] But the best deal of the day? Draw any sketch, and View turns it into a 3D model in 30 seconds.", "words": [[0.0, 0.08, "What"], [0.133, 0.24, "if"], [0.28, 0.4, "you"], [0.5, 0.8, "had"], [0.86, 1.04, "one"], [1.1, 1.28, "day"], [1.307, 1.36, "in"], [1.44, 2.24, "Delhi,"], [2.28, 2.4, "and"], [2.44, 2.56, "you"], [2.6, 2.72, "had"], [2.773, 2.88, "to"], [2.92, 3